From e661073e2383e2e4db5682b8656dca66e25c25bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 05:42:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Production gets the design-version picker too

The staging bar and picker now render on production as well, with a
grey Production chip. A browser that never picked a version still gets
PRODUCTION_VERSION (v4); staging's default stays v1. Pins on
production still ignore the version.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
